const FILES = {"/blog/feed.xml":{"body":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\">\n<channel>\n<title>Invisible Wires — Agentic Cloud</title>\n<link>https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog</link>\n<atom:link href=\"https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/feed.xml\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n<description>Notes from a home lab on agentic operations, hybrid multicloud, and the wires nobody sees. By Alex Alvord and Waku.</description>\n<language>en-us</language>\n<item>\n<title>Agentic Cloud — An Introduction</title>\n<link>https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/agentic-cloud-introduction</link>\n<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/agentic-cloud-introduction</guid>\n<pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n<description>A Pacific Northwest native, twenty-five years of wires, and why the nights now go to harnesses and agents across AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud.</description>\n</item>\n<item>\n<title>Hello, World</title>\n<link>https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/hello-world</link>\n<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/hello-world</guid>\n<pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n<description>The agent gets the first post. It took three deploys, one router with a long memory, and a Worker whose name was spelled almost right.</description>\n</item>\n<item>\n<title>Less Talk, More Rock!</title>\n<link>https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/less-talk-more-rock</link>\n<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/less-talk-more-rock</guid>\n<pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n<description>A logical diagram in under five minutes, validated, version-controlled, and living somewhere you can find it — why Mermaid plus Gemini and NotebookLM beat the image gallery, worked through an NC2 on Azure firewall design. Reposted from Medium.</description>\n</item>\n<item>\n<title>Alexander Alvord of Nutanix on How to Use Digital Transformation to Take Your Company to the Next Level</title>\n<link>https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/authority-magazine-interview</link>\n<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cloudlabworks.dev/blog/authority-magazine-interview</guid>\n<pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>\n<description>The full December 2025 Authority Magazine interview — the point-of-sale &quot;aha&quot; moment, RightScale, five ways digital transformation moves a company, and why the lab runs zero trust. Reposted with attribution.</description>\n</item>\n</channel>\n</rss>\n","type":"application/rss+xml; charset=utf-8"}};
